      "_id": "Bn0na0fPsSKZaQLt",
      "img": "icons/commodities/tech/console-steel.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>As a maneuver, a creature adjacent to an exploding mill wheel that isn’t rolling can make an [[/test A]].</p><dl class=\"power-roll-display\"><dt class=\"tier1\"><p>!</p></dt><dd><p>The creature accidentally activates the <strong>Roll the Wheel</strong> ability.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier2\"><p>@</p></dt><dd><p>The exploding mill wheel is deactivated but the creature is [[/apply slowed turn]].</p></dd><dt class=\"tier3\"><p>#</p></dt><dd><p>The exploding mill wheel is deactivated and can’t be used.</p></dd></dl><p>Once the wheel is rolling, it can’t be deactivated. However, it can be exploded early by destroying it or blocking its movement with a suitably large creature or object. </p>",
          "director": ""
        },
